      "standardized_narrative": "The Syndicate opened 2017 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 180.1m. Analysis of the gross claims development triangle indicates a net favourable prior year development of approximately GBP 5.3m (a ~2.9% release of opening reserves), driven predominantly by favourable claims development and reinsurance recoveries on older years. The 2017 underwriting year was materially impacted by multiple US natural catastrophe events (Harvey, Irma, Maria), California wildfires and Mexico earthquakes, which increased 2017 losses but were largely mitigated by the purchased reinsurance programme. Older years (2011-2015) show modest net release overall in the development triangle.",
